@talentId = 2

### Get all talents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifitalent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get talent by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifitalent/{{talentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create a talent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifitalent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Resourcefulness",
    "description": "Ability to make do with what's available.",
    "ability": "Once per session, improvise a tool or solution from available materials."
}

###

### Update a talent
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifitalent/{{talentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Resourcefulness",
    "description": "Updated description.",
    "ability": "Updated ability."
}

###

### Partial update - name only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifitalent/{{talentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Resourcefulness Updated"
}

###

### Delete a talent
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifitalent/{{talentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}